<h2>The timeline that decided the case</h2>
<div class="flow">
  <div class="fstep"><strong>29 November 2021.</strong> Alleged incident: a group assault on the informant&rsquo;s uncle and cousin, with the informant himself allegedly struck with a pistol butt. Nadi P.S. Case No. 354 of 2021 follows.</div>
  <div class="fstep"><strong>2022.</strong> The Sessions Court rejects the petitioners&rsquo; anticipatory bail plea.</div>
